and_or_mixed.plain, line 4: Add brackets, or reword this, so it has only one meaning.

    if a and b or c
       ^^^^^^^^^^^^
Try one of these:
    if a and (b or c)
  or
    if (a and b) or c
Why: Plain can read it two ways, and it never guesses which one you mean.

